false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/155/attachments/0/title_link", "parent_pointer": "/155/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "https://www.tryfondo.com/special-pricing", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/167/text", "parent_pointer": "/167", "encoding": "json", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> need your help with this step on Fondo", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/169/text", "parent_pointer": "/169", "encoding": "json", "text": "I don\u2019t have the admin tab. I believe you are the only \u201cprimary admin\u201d. Can you please add Fondo when you get a chance?", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/175/text", "parent_pointer": "/175", "encoding": "json", "text": "Just finished Fondo onboarding", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/194/text", "parent_pointer": "/194", "encoding": "json", "text": "so $50 for filing. I don\u2019t know what the rest of the difference is but ballpark chatgpt is in line with Fondo", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-03.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-03.json", "pointer": "/1/text", "parent_pointer": "/1", "encoding": "json", "text": "pinged Fondo for other tax submission, trying to learn about due dates", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-06.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-06.json", "pointer": "/134/text", "parent_pointer": "/134", "encoding": "json", "text": "r franchise tax but please double check the work and the amount and let me know if you have questions/concerns. I can pass the questions along to the Fondo team", "truncated": true}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-08.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-08.json", "pointer": "/35/text", "parent_pointer": "/35", "encoding": "json", "text": "We will change it again per Fondo\u2019s instructions once we start making money lol ", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-08.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2024-08.json", "pointer": "/36/text", "parent_pointer": "/36", "encoding": "json", "text": "Btw I ordered r&amp;d tax study when were doing tax submissions via Fondo. It costs $2188 and we will get $14453 credit. Pretty good $10K saving on taxes. \n\nFrom [PERSON_NAME_7251] on how it\u2019s gonna work: \n\nThe Federal R&amp;D tax credit was claimed as a payroll tax credit. The payroll tax credit is an alternative method of claiming the R&amp;D tax credit. It is beneficial for companies that owe no federal income tax. This credit is a refund of certain payroll taxes the company will pay beginning in Q4 2024. The IRS will issue the refund as a quarterly check, which typically takes a few months", "truncated": true}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-02.json", "pointer": "/9/text", "parent_pointer": "/9", "encoding": "json", "text": "I\u2019m done with all except the Fondo thing for Delaware franchise tax - I got the cap table, working on the other piece now", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-02.json", "pointer": "/10/text", "parent_pointer": "/10", "encoding": "json", "text": "DE franchise tax docs and data is submitted to Fondo - CCed you guys on the email. I think all admin stuff is done for now", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-04.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-04.json", "pointer": "/51/text", "parent_pointer": "/51", "encoding": "json", "text": "I didn\u2019t realize I got this email from Fondo", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-09.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/2/text", "parent_pointer": "/2", "encoding": "json", "text": "Fondo guys did the whole R&amp;D thing again", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-09.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/4/text", "parent_pointer": "/4", "encoding": "json", "text": "we\u2019ll pay $5K to Fondo for that r&amp;d credit paperwork but I think it\u2019s fair", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-09.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/10/text", "parent_pointer": "/10", "encoding": "json", "text": "was that from Fondo?", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-09.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/13/text", "parent_pointer": "/13", "encoding": "json", "text": "not from Fondo", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-09.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UEQVDVB7/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/15/text", "parent_pointer": "/15", "encoding": "json", "text": "but Fondo did the work", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1920/text", "parent_pointer": "/1920", "encoding": "json", "text": "<https://www.tryfondo.com/special-pricing>", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1920/attachments/0/from_url", "parent_pointer": "/1920/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "https://www.tryfondo.com/special-pricing", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1920/attachments/0/original_url", "parent_pointer": "/1920/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "https://www.tryfondo.com/special-pricing", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1920/attachments/0/service_name", "parent_pointer": "/1920/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "tryfondo.com", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1920/attachments/0/text", "parent_pointer": "/1920/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "Fondo is an all-in-one accounting platform for startups. We'll handle your bookkeeping, tax, and tax credits so you can focus on building your startup.", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1920/attachments/0/title_link", "parent_pointer": "/1920/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "https://www.tryfondo.com/special-pricing", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1929/text", "parent_pointer": "/1929", "encoding": "json", "text": "this is Fondo: <https://www.finsmes.com/2023/02/Fondo-raises-3m-in-pre-seed-funding.html>", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1929/attachments/0/fallback", "parent_pointer": "/1929/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "FinSMEs: Fondo Raises $3M in Pre-Seed Funding", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1929/attachments/0/from_url", "parent_pointer": "/1929/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "https://www.finsmes.com/2023/02/fondo-raises-3m-in-pre-seed-funding.html", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1929/attachments/0/image_url", "parent_pointer": "/1929/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "https://www.finsmes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Fondo.jpeg", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1929/attachments/0/original_url", "parent_pointer": "/1929/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "https://www.finsmes.com/2023/02/fondo-raises-3m-in-pre-seed-funding.html", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1929/attachments/0/text", "parent_pointer": "/1929/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "Fondo, a San Francisco, CA-based all-in-one accounting platform provider, raised $3M in Pre-Seed funding", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1929/attachments/0/title", "parent_pointer": "/1929/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "Fondo Raises $3M in Pre-Seed Funding", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1929/attachments/0/title_link", "parent_pointer": "/1929/attachments/0", "encoding": "json", "text": "https://www.finsmes.com/2023/02/fondo-raises-3m-in-pre-seed-funding.html", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1936/text", "parent_pointer": "/1936", "encoding": "json", "text": "Yeah, I think for 23 taxes we take the risk and go for Fondo\ntax services are similar and we don\u2019t need accounting yet I feel like", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1938/text", "parent_pointer": "/1938", "encoding": "json", "text": "I don\u2019t think we\u2019ll get any nice human touch with Fondo tbh", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1941/text", "parent_pointer": "/1941", "encoding": "json", "text": "final call - [USERNAME_2035]  or Fondo?", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1942/text", "parent_pointer": "/1942", "encoding": "json", "text": "Fondo", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1943/text", "parent_pointer": "/1943", "encoding": "json", "text": "ok I\u2019ll go ahead then with Fondo", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/1944/text", "parent_pointer": "/1944", "encoding": "json", "text": "Signed up for Fondo but onboarding has many steps", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-07.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-07.json", "pointer": "/25/text", "parent_pointer": "/25", "encoding": "json", "text": "I\u2019m sending some follow up messages to Fondo :\n\nHi [PERSON_NAME_6256],\n\nThank you for preparing the tax return. I had a chance to review the document but since this is our first time doing this, I have a few questions.\n\nIt looks like what\u2019s driving our franchise tax is based on the net worth calculation which is $2.4M and North Carolina charges about 0.15% of your net worth. The company didn\u2019t exist for the entirety of 2023 though and we were established in April and received funding on July 23. Does the state offer prorated rates or do they just look at your end of year balance and charge a f", "truncated": true}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-07.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-07.json", "pointer": "/43/text", "parent_pointer": "/43", "encoding": "json", "text": "yeah, that\u2019s the bigger question and I don\u2019t think we will get straight answer from Fondo tax guys. We need someone shady lollolol", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-07.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-07.json", "pointer": "/58/text", "parent_pointer": "/58", "encoding": "json", "text": "ok, I\u2019m sticking with Fondo - decision is finalized", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-07.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-07.json", "pointer": "/313/text", "parent_pointer": "/313", "encoding": "json", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID> can you remind me what the Fondo call is about?", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-07.json", "service_file": "messages/C04UTBZL6AX/2024-07.json", "pointer": "/324/text", "parent_pointer": "/324", "encoding": "json", "text": "I talked to [PERSON_NAME_6256] from Fondo, she was great :[USERNAME_33559]:", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C808DB6CD448/2025-04.json", "service_file": "messages/C808DB6CD448/2025-04.json", "pointer": "/42/text", "parent_pointer": "/42", "encoding": "json", "text": "Bien raro esta mierda, porque el texto que esta enfrente es dinamico tambien, y se localiza bien a la primera, y el texto que aparece atras del Fondo negro transparente, tambien es dinamico pero se localiza mal la primera vez que abro esa pantalla", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C808DB6CD448/2025-06.json", "service_file": "messages/C808DB6CD448/2025-06.json", "pointer": "/279/text", "parent_pointer": "/279", "encoding": "json", "text": "siii pero la onda es que en Figma, el NavigationBar se ve como en el Fondo y actualmente esta activo", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C808DB6CD448/2025-06.json", "service_file": "messages/C808DB6CD448/2025-06.json", "pointer": "/286/text", "parent_pointer": "/286", "encoding": "json", "text": "tenes razon, parece que tiene que estar al Fondo debajo del Fondo negro transparente", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D04UGG61DUM/2025-07.json", "service_file": "messages/D04UGG61DUM/2025-07.json", "pointer": "/52/text", "parent_pointer": "/52", "encoding": "json", "text": "I applied to it via Fondo", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D051LNQSFGQ/2024-05.json", "service_file": "messages/D051LNQSFGQ/2024-05.json", "pointer": "/70/text", "parent_pointer": "/70", "encoding": "json", "text": "Is this a good translation?\n\n```&lt;color=#B813B1&gt; \u00a1Combina las fichas &lt;/color&gt; antes de que lleguen al Fondo! Toque en cualquier lugar para continuar.```", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D051LNQSFGQ/2024-05.json", "service_file": "messages/D051LNQSFGQ/2024-05.json", "pointer": "/75/text", "parent_pointer": "/75", "encoding": "json", "text": "```&lt;color=#B813B1&gt;\u00a1Combina las fichas&lt;/color&gt; antes de que lleguen al Fondo!. Toca en cualquier parte para continuar. ```", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05GU6L0XFH/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/D05GU6L0XFH/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/19/files/2/name", "parent_pointer": "/19/files/2", "encoding": "json", "text": "personaje-nina-bruja-3d-fondo-simple-generado-ai_894279-2534.avif", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05GU6L0XFH/2024-02.json", "service_file": "messages/D05GU6L0XFH/2024-02.json", "pointer": "/19/files/2/permalink", "parent_pointer": "/19/files/2", "encoding": "json", "text": "https://harmonygamesgroup.slack.com/files/EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID/F06HA4CPVGA/personaje-nina-bruja-3d-fondo-simple-generado-ai_894279-2534.avif", "truncated": false}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05GU6L0XFH/2024-02.json", "ser